msgstr "駐車罰金: 30 ドルを支払います。"

#: internal/games/fortune.go:814
msgid "You won a crossword: collect $50."
msgstr "あなたはクロスワードに当選しました。50 ドルを集めてください。"

#: internal/games/fortune.go:815
msgid "Buy everyone lunch: pay each player $15."
msgstr "全員に昼食を奢る：各プレーヤーに１５ドルを支払う。"

#: internal/games/fortune.go:816
msgid "Caught jaywalking: go to jail."
msgstr "歩道橋を歩いているところを捕まり、刑務所に行きます。"

#: internal/games/fortune.go:817
msgid "A card left on a bench: take it."
msgstr "ベンチに置き忘れのカード: もらいましょう。"

#: internal/games/fortune.go:818
msgid "The shopkeeper owes you a favour: take a card."
msgstr "店主があなたに借りがあります: カードを 1 枚どうぞ。"

#: internal/games/fortune.go:819
msgid "You won a raffle: take a card."
msgstr "くじに当たりました: カードを 1 枚どうぞ。"

#: internal/games/fortune.go:848
msgid "Chance for %s: %s"
msgstr "%[1]s のチャンス: %[2]s"

#: internal/games/fortune.go:851
msgid "%s takes a card: %s."
msgstr "%s はカードを引きました: %s。"

#: internal/games/fortune.go:948
msgid "%s sold a house on %s for $%d."
msgstr "%[1]sは、%[2]sの家を$%[3]dで販売した。"

#: internal/games/fortune.go:952
msgid "%s sold %s to the bank for $%d."
msgstr "%[1]sは、%[2]sを$%[3]dで銀行に販売した。"

#: internal/games/fortune.go:966
msgid "%s is bankrupt and out of the game."
msgstr "%sは破産し、ゲームから外れた。"

#: internal/games/fortune.go:1001
msgid "%s sleeps through their turn."
msgstr "%s は眠っていて番を休みます。"

#: internal/games/fortune.go:1021
msgid "%s won with $%d in worth."
msgstr "%[1]s は $%[2]d の価値で勝ちました。"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:53
msgid "Loaded Dice"
msgstr "イカサマサイコロ"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:53
msgid "Before you roll: walk the number of squares you choose instead. At a fork, chance still picks the road."
msgstr "サイコロを振る前に: 代わりに好きなマス数だけ進みます。分かれ道では、やはり運が道を選びます。"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:54
msgid "Free Rent"
msgstr "家賃免除"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:54
msgid "The next rent you owe is not paid."
msgstr "次に払う家賃は払わずに済みます。"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:55
msgid "Requisition"
msgstr "強制買収"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:55
msgid "Buy the rival's property you stand on, buildings and all, paying its owner what it cost."
msgstr "今いるライバルの物件を建物ごと買い取ります。持ち主にはかかった額を払います。"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:56
msgid "Pickpocket"
msgstr "スリ"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:56
msgid "Take a card, at random, from a rival's hand."
msgstr "ライバルの手札からカードを 1 枚、無作為に取ります。"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:57
msgid "Demolition"
msgstr "取り壊し"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:57
msgid "Pull down a building on a rival's street: pick the street on the board first."
msgstr "ライバルの通りの建物を 1 つ取り壊します: 先に盤上で通りを選んでください。"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:58
msgid "Building Permit"
msgstr "建築許可"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:58
msgid "Put up a building on a street of yours, free: pick the street on the board first."
msgstr "自分の通りに無料で建物を 1 つ建てます: 先に盤上で通りを選んでください。"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:59
msgid "Turtle"
msgstr "カメ"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:59
msgid "A player of your choice walks one square a roll for their next three rolls."
msgstr "選んだプレイヤーは、次の 3 回、1 回に 1 マスしか進めません。"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:60
msgid "Swap Places"
msgstr "位置交換"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:60
msgid "Change places with a rival; neither of you lands anywhere."
msgstr "ライバルと位置を入れ替えます。どちらもマスに止まったことにはなりません。"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:61
msgid "Jail Pass"
msgstr "出所券"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:61
msgid "Walk out of jail before you roll, without paying bail."
msgstr "サイコロを振る前に、保釈金を払わずに刑務所を出ます。"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:62
msgid "Tax Audit"
msgstr "税務調査"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:62
msgid "A rival pays a tenth of their cash into the fountain."
msgstr "ライバル 1 人が所持金の 10 分の 1 を噴水に払います。"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:63
msgid "Fair Shares"
msgstr "山分け"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:63
msgid "Everyone's cash is pooled and shared out equally."
msgstr "全員の所持金を合わせて、均等に分けます。"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:64
msgid "Sleeping Pill"
msgstr "睡眠薬"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:64
msgid "A rival misses their next turn."
msgstr "ライバル 1 人が次の番を休みます。"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:89
msgid "%s's hand is full: no card."
msgstr "%s の手札がいっぱいです: カードはもらえません。"

#: internal/games/fortune_cards.go:95
